      "value": "@{5fb74a89aa70e657a51fa62e|full_name}: Ah, sorry! In that case you could still do something avatar-related to show that you're deafened. Because there's a few things that might make your request difficult...\n- Setting VRChat to 0% volume actually sets it to 6.25% (it's a long standing bug)\n- There's multiple ways to deafen yourself - through VRChat, or through your operating system. I'm not sure VRChat can account for that.\nHappy holidays!",
